            <td style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;" colspan="3">
                <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Specific Objective:</b> Speaking: productive: Identify things in simple pictures, using isolated words.<br>interactive: Express likes or dislikes using simple words and pointing.</p>
                <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Learning Outcome:</b> Speaking: Can identify things in simple pictures, using isolated words (e.g., 'art' or 'games').<br>Can express likes or dislikes to peers using simple words and pointing (e.g., 'I like music!' while pointing to a picture).<br>Can respond to simple questions like 'Do you like it?' with 'yes' or 'no' and gestures (e.g., nodding).</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
